{"id":3246,"slug":"3246-toref-torefs-tovalue-dung-khi-nao","category":"Vue.js","subcategory":"Chuyên Sâu","level":"intermediate","question_vi":"`toRef`, `toRefs`, `toValue` — dùng khi nào?","question_en":"`toRef`, `toRefs`, `toValue` — when to use?","answer_vi":"`toRef`: tạo ref từ một property của reactive object — giữ reactive connection:\n```javascript\nconst state = reactive({ count: 0, name: 'Vue' })\nconst countRef = toRef(state, 'count') // linked to state.count\n```\n`toRefs`: convert toàn bộ reactive object thành object of refs — dùng khi destructure:\n```javascript\nconst { count, name } = toRefs(state)\n```\n`toValue` (Vue 3.3+): unwrap ref hoặc getter — dùng trong composables để accept cả ref và plain value:\n```javascript\nfunction useFeature(id: MaybeRefOrGetter<string>) {\n  const resolvedId = toValue(id) // unwrap nếu là ref\n}\n```","answer_en":"`toRef`: creates a ref from a property of a reactive object — maintains reactive connection:\n```javascript\nconst state = reactive({ count: 0, name: 'Vue' })\nconst countRef = toRef(state, 'count') // linked to state.count\n```\n`toRefs`: converts the entire reactive object into an object of refs — use when destructuring:\n```javascript\nconst { count, name } = toRefs(state)\n```\n`toValue` (Vue 3.3+): unwraps a ref or getter — use in composables to accept both ref and plain values:\n```javascript\nfunction useFeature(id: MaybeRefOrGetter<string>) {\n  const resolvedId = toValue(id) // unwraps if ref\n}\n```","answer_html_vi":"<p><code>toRef</code>: tạo ref từ một property của reactive object — giữ reactive connection:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const state = reactive({ count: 0, name: 'Vue' })\nconst countRef = toRef(state, 'count') // linked to state.count\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> state = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">count</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Vue&#x27;</span> })\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> countRef = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toRef</span>(state, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;count&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// linked to state.count</span></code></pre></div><p><code>toRefs</code>: convert toàn bộ reactive object thành object of refs — dùng khi destructure:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const { count, name } = toRefs(state)\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> { count, name } = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toRefs</span>(state)</code></pre></div><p><code>toValue</code> (Vue 3.3+): unwrap ref hoặc getter — dùng trong composables để accept cả ref và plain value:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"function useFeature(id: MaybeRefOrGetter&lt;string&gt;) {\n  const resolvedId = toValue(id) // unwrap nếu là ref\n}\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">function</span> <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">useFeature</span>(<span class=\"hljs-params\">id: MaybeRefOrGetter&lt;string&gt;</span>) {\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> resolvedId = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toValue</span>(id) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// unwrap nếu là ref</span>\n}</code></pre></div>","answer_html_en":"<p><code>toRef</code>: creates a ref from a property of a reactive object — maintains reactive connection:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const state = reactive({ count: 0, name: 'Vue' })\nconst countRef = toRef(state, 'count') // linked to state.count\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-default\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h9a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1\"/></svg><svg class=\"qa-code-copy-icon-done\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 6 9 17l-5-5\"/></svg><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-default\">Copy</span><span class=\"qa-code-copy-label-done\">Copied</span></button><pre class=\"qa-code-pre\"><code class=\"qa-code-block hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> state = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">reactive</span>({ <span class=\"hljs-attr\">count</span>: <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span>, <span class=\"hljs-attr\">name</span>: <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;Vue&#x27;</span> })\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">const</span> countRef = <span class=\"hljs-title function_\">toRef</span>(state, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;count&#x27;</span>) <span class=\"hljs-comment\">// linked to state.count</span></code></pre></div><p><code>toRefs</code>: converts the entire reactive object into an object of refs — use when destructuring:</p><div class=\"qa-code-wrap\"><span class=\"qa-code-lang\">javascript</span><button type=\"button\" class=\"qa-code-copy\" data-code=\"const { count, name } = toRefs(state)\" aria-label=\"Cop